	quest.60C2A51D9D5B3449.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: Create brass sheets and iron chains, the boots sheets and leather, the bascinet a norman helmet and 2 brass sheets.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: ready pieces sometimes lie in the chests of Nether castles, fortresses and bastions.",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: 16 armour, 4 toughness, +2 health.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
