	quest.31A17ED3B19C63AA.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the half armour is 6 iron ingots and 2 Create iron sheets, the barbute 3 ingots and 2 sheets, the hussar chestplate a half armour, 6 feathers, a rabbit hide and a stick.",
		" ",
		"The half armour and barbute are the base of steel plate. Tier T1: 8 armour for the helmet and half armour.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.364187F101631D7F.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.657ED9E1A9327981.title: "Knight's Plate"
	quest.657ED9E1A9327981.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the knight chestplate is a half armour and 5 steel plates, the armet a barbute and 3 plates, the leggings 7 plates, the boots 4. 2 TFMG steel ingots make 2 plates.",
		" ",
		"Tier T4: 20 armour, 10 toughness, 0.4 knockback resistance, +4 health, no slowness.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.40A846C5E4A441E0.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.3438447756AD852E.title: "The Tournament"
	quest.3438447756AD852E.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: every piece is a knight plate piece plus more steel plates, the frog-mouth helm a barbute and 8 plates.",
		" ",
		"22 armour, 10 toughness, +4 health, no knockback, but every piece gives Slowness II: this is plate for mounted combat with the chivalry lance.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.38A138395836D47B.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.625291F2050E0432.title: "Maximilian Armour"
	quest.625291F2050E0432.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: smithing table: a netherite upgrade template, a knight plate piece and a netherite ingot.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the template is in Nether bastion chests.",
		" ",
		"Tier T5 like netherite: 20 armour, 12 toughness, 0.4 knockback resistance, +6 health, no slowness.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.25D69997310AFC35.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.5B793200B6CCE2ED.title: "Gothic Plate"
	quest.5B793200B6CCE2ED.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the sallet is a barbute and 3 steel plates, the chestplate a half armour, 5 plates and 2 steel nuggets, the leggings and boots plates and nuggets.",
		" ",
		"Tier T4: 20 armour, 10 toughness, +4 health. It upgrades to netherite on the smithing table, keeping its enchantments.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.02B64E9B9E4E16EA.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.00F576F383A93517.title: "Kastenbrust"
	quest.00F576F383A93517.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the grand bascinet is a norman helmet and 5 steel plates, the chestplate a half armour, 5 plates and 2 small steel plates (6 steel nuggets make 8), the leggings and boots plates and small plates.",
		" ",
		"Tier T4 like knight plate. It upgrades to netherite, keeping its enchantments.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.53CDAD1EAA433E71.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.57207835097E4913.title: "Rusted Mail"
	quest.57207835097E4913.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be forged, only found.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: in the chests of castles, citadels, armouries and strongholds, together with a rusted great helm and crusader chestplate.",
		" ",
		"Tier T1: 12 armour, like new mail. The quest opens nothing.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.5CFD3D6AA54DBA9A.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.33DAE07EA6AF67A4.title: "Salvager"
	quest.33DAE07EA6AF67A4.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the suit, waders and boots are leather, iron ingots and ship graveyard echoes.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: Ice Maze creatures drop the echoes: anglerfish, maws, scuttlers, spinefish and abyssal scyphoids; the helmet cannot be crafted, Captain Cornelia of the pirate ship in the maze drops it.",
		" ",
		"Tier T1: 15 armour for the full set; faster swimming and mining underwater, and depth's resilience protects you from the maze creatures.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.238D19158E00A89B.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.3BC4DBD7C46A9301.title: "Terrible Armour"
	quest.3BC4DBD7C46A9301.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: smithing table: the terrible template, an iron piece and a fin. The template copies: a template, 4 angler fangs and 4 fins make two.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: all in the Ice Maze. Eels, anglerfish and maws drop fins; the template lies in pirate pouches and treasure pouches, which the maze pillagers, eels and maws drop and which lie in its barrels and frozen chests.",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: 16 armour, 4 toughness, +2 health.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.74F80249F6DD7D0C.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.3839C02C25DF9125.title: "Abyssal Armour"
	quest.3839C02C25DF9125.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: smithing table: the abyssal template, a diamond piece and an abyssal amethyst. The template: a terrible template, 4 abyssal amethysts and 4 ship graveyard echoes.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the maze mother in the Ice Maze drops 2-6 amethysts, and now and then they lie in treasure pouches.",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: 20 armour, 8 toughness, +2 health, the highest depth's resilience. The abyssal tiara (a totem and an amethyst) can replace the helmet.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.6870F8D32D22A6B4.title: "Monster Trophies"
	quest.6870F8D32D22A6B4.quest_desc: [
		"These sets are made from mini-boss and rare-mob loot, or drop ready-made. The quests for ready-made loot open nothing; they just mark a finished set. T6 trophy armour (ignitium, cursium, warden, annihilator) is forged on netherite pieces, so it sits in the metal branch after netherite.",
	]
	task.4603924CFE8432B0.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.671570D4F48FA9CC.title: "Mutant Skeleton Armour"
	quest.671570D4F48FA9CC.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: a mutant skeleton falls apart into bones. 6 ribs make a rib cage, 2 shoulder pads and 4 limbs make arms, arms over the cage make the chestplate; the leggings are the pelvis and limbs, the boots limbs.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the mutant skeleton is a very rare giant that spawns where normal skeletons do.",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: 15 armour and 3 toughness together.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.7967AD3521F044EB.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.4DB0B29951E80979.title: "Bone Reptile Armour"
	quest.4DB0B29951E80979.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the chestplate is 4 ancient metal ingots and 4 koboleton bones, the helmet also takes a kobolediator skull.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: koboletons and the Kobolediator live in Cataclysm desert structures (compass: Desert Site, Desert Temple); ancient metal drops from them and from the Wadjet and lies in desert treasure.",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: 10 armour and 2 toughness together, and they resist knockback.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.1158D7A0B717A7D0.title: "Mossy Chestplate"
	quest.1158D7A0B717A7D0.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the nature crystal, 2 moss blocks, 4 chiseled stone bricks and an iron block.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the Overgrown Colossus drops the nature crystal in the mossy temple (compass: Mossy Temple).",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: 8 armour, 2 toughness, resists knockback. The R key releases poison clouds that hurt mobs and heal you.",
	]
	task.2DD4B3C696E30741.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.39E14246D31E4509.title: "Dragon Bones"
	quest.39E14246D31E4509.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: dragon bones: 8 for the chestplate, the leggings and boots are bones too.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the Infernal Dragon drops the bones in the Dragon Tower (compass: Dragon Tower).",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: 17 armour and 6 toughness together. Every piece adds a dodge roll (set the key in the controls) and shortens burning.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	task.402BBDAC70E0E66A.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.0AC4EE60A85F7F5F.title: "Warped Armour"
	quest.0AC4EE60A85F7F5F.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the chestplate is 4 bolok scales and 4 spunkler spines, the boots bolok scales and a bolok fin.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: boloks and spunklers live in the End's warped reefs; scales, fins and spines also lie in warped ship chests.",
		" ",
		"Tier T4: 11 armour, 5 toughness and +2 health together, a slightly slower step. In the boots you can stand on warped bubbles.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.312598F9B29FBDA5.title: "Sol Visage"
	quest.312598F9B29FBDA5.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be crafted, it is a trophy.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: Umvuthi, chief of the Umvuthana grove in the savanna, drops the mask (compass: Umvuthana Grove).",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: as protective as a diamond helmet.",
	]
	task.1B9669AC21E96607.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.7A05AF0987081E2B.title: "Geomancer's Garb"
	quest.7A05AF0987081E2B.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be crafted, it is a trophy.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: after the trial in the mountain monastery (compass: Monastery) the Sculptor leaves his staff or one of the pieces; the monastery chests hold pieces too.",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: 20 armour, 8 toughness, +2 health.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.13663CEA9C4B4A51.title: "Wrought Helm"
	quest.13663CEA9C4B4A51.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be crafted, it is a trophy.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the Ferrous Wroughtnaut drops the helm in the underground halls (compass: Wrought Chamber) when a player kills it.",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: like a diamond helmet, resists knockback.",
	]
	task.3F3ABABEF22A4330.title: "Any piece of the set"
	quest.5C4E2E06B8F02EA7.title: "Dragon Tower Plate"
	quest.5C4E2E06B8F02EA7.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be crafted, only found.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the pieces lie in the chests of the Dragon Tower (compass: Dragon Tower) and in the rare chests of the Underworld Knight's arena (compass: Underworld Arena).",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: 20 armour, 8 toughness, +2 health.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7One piece of the set completes the quest, the rest are optional (click a piece for its recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.7C5BFE658385002B.title: "Ancient Helmet"
	quest.7C5BFE658385002B.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: it cannot be crafted, it is a trophy.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the Ancient Blaze, a Living Things fire boss, drops the helmet. It is summoned by a ritual: a jack o'lantern on top of two glowstone blocks. When it dies it calls 4 normal blazes.",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: like a diamond helmet, gives fire resistance.",
	]
	image.712139F6C8DE77E0.title: "Metal"
	image.3093F92EAF2FC5C6.title: "Immersive Armors"
	image.3C8A5ADC4839D0FB.title: "Epic Knights"
	image.46B204EFCEA61D4F.title: "Ice Maze"
	image.53B1B8C748B84192.title: "Monster Trophies"
	chapter.35A43AB9AA47B8F6.title: "&#D96C3BWeapons&r"
	chapter.35A43AB9AA47B8F6.subtitle: "Melee weapons and bows by branch and tier: how to make them and where to get them. Every quest but the first is optional."
	quest.79A5EFDD69A29C72.title: "The Armoury"
	quest.79A5EFDD69A29C72.quest_desc: [
		"This chapter is a weapons guide. A quest shows a whole family: clicking any item opens its recipe in JEI.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"The branches do not depend on each other and go up the tiers from left to right: §6swords§r · §6maces, hammers and hatchets§r · §6polearms§r: spears, pikes, halberds · §6daggers and stilettos§r · §6bows and crossbows§r · §6the sea§r: Ice Maze weapons and neptunium. Later quests wait for their era (brass, steel, netherite), T6 trophies for their boss.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"A weapon's tooltip shows attack damage and attack speed (hits per second); their product is a rough melee strength. Marks: §7T0§r 6-8 · §fT1§r 9-10 · §6T2§r 11-12 · §bT3§r 11-13 · §9T4§r 15-16 · §5T5§r 17-18 · §cT6§r 19-23. Fast weapons hit softer, heavy ones hit rarely, polearms reach further, Epic Knights two-handers get weaker while the off hand is busy.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Firearms and cannons are in Arsenal and Defence, Mowzie's weapons in Dungeons and Mini-Bosses.",
	]
	task.60FE4BDDA94FEBC4.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.7D83B82221448BE7.title: "Copper Swords"
	quest.7D83B82221448BE7.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the Create Stuff & Additions copper sword is 2 copper ingots and a stick. Epic Knights swords are built on a hilt: 2 leather make 6 leather strips, a stick and a strip make a hilt. The short sword and the katzbalger are 2 ingots and a hilt, the bastard sword a short sword and one more ingot.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T0: damage 3.5-5.3, speed 1.4-1.7.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	task.0CD7F6ED311B8302.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.7258126D7955C827.title: "Iron Swords"
	quest.7258126D7955C827.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the zinc sword is 2 zinc ingots and a stick. Epic Knights: the short sword and the katzbalger are 2 iron ingots and a hilt, the bastard sword and the claymore a short sword and an ingot (different shapes), the zweihander a short sword, 3 ingots and a hilt, the messer a short sword, an ingot and a nugget. The claymore and zweihander are two-handed: harder hits, slower swings.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T1: damage 5-9.9, speed 1.0-1.8.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	task.7EF1AAED4A7CEC7D.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.0DA7C1628996CF9D.title: "Create Swords"
	quest.0DA7C1628996CF9D.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the brass sword is 2 brass ingots and a stick. The rose quartz sword is built on a mechanical crafter: 2 polished rose quartz, 2 iron sheets, a gold ingot and a zinc handle. The blazing cleaver is a golden sword and powdered obsidian in a heated mixer.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: damage 6-7.5, speed 1.6-1.8.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	task.6E47FD8D25832EA3.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.717E9AA13689F64E.title: "Diamond Swords"
	quest.717E9AA13689F64E.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: diamond Epic Knights swords are made like the iron ones. The flame-bladed sword is smithed: a netherite upgrade template, a diamond zweihander and blaze powder (the template is used up). Diamond swords later upgrade to netherite.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: damage 6.3-11.3, speed 0.9-1.7.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.6A5FE136D8C03DD2.title: "Resonarium Sword"
	quest.6A5FE136D8C03DD2.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: smithing table: a resonarium upgrade template, a diamond sword and a resonarium plate (4 resonarium and 4 turtle or armadillo scutes).",
		" ",
		"Where to get: resonarium drops from sludges in the Otherside, the template lies in the chests at the top of the Otherside's ancient temple.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T3: damage 7, speed 1.6.",
	]
	task.2CDAE06A448ACBA5.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.5801D4A152775691.title: "Steel Swords"
	quest.5801D4A152775691.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: TFMG, 2 steel or aluminium ingots and a stick. The lithium blade: a steel sword, a heavy plate, a circuit board, a spark plug, 2 aluminium plates and copper wire. The refined radiance sword is sequenced assembly on a stick: rose quartz, a stick, refined radiance, lava, water, more radiance and a press (radiance: 2 glowstone dust, 2 powdered obsidian and rose quartz in a mixer). Epic Knights swords are made like the iron ones from TFMG steel.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T4: damage 6.5-15.7, speed 1.0-2.0. The TFMG steel sword is 9.5 and 1.6.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	task.671AB88F8EDBC446.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.51DA7801A67108D4.title: "Netherite Swords"
	quest.51DA7801A67108D4.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: smithing table: a netherite upgrade template, a diamond sword of the same kind and a netherite ingot. Netherite is made only in a superheated mixer: 4 scrap, 2 gold and 2 TFMG steel. The netherite sword is the base of Fantasy Weapons, the gear sword, the Incinerator and the warden sword.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T5: damage 10.5-20.3, speed 0.7-1.7. The netherite sword is 10.5 and 1.6.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.7250BC396A7E5C1A.title: "Blazing Stone"
	quest.7250BC396A7E5C1A.quest_desc: [
		"Fantasy Weapons: 76 legendary weapons: claymores, katanas, halberds, rapiers, hammers.",
		" ",
		"How to make: a Blazing Stone is 4 blaze powder, 4 glowstone dust and stone. Smithing table: the template slot takes the item that picks the weapon (iron ingot for the Hero Claymore, raw copper for the Kingslayer), then a netherite sword and the blazing stone. JEI shows every recipe.",
	]
	quest.5D2B6635742EA1A0.title: "Weapon of Legends"
	quest.5D2B6635742EA1A0.quest_desc: [
		"Any Fantasy Weapons weapon counts.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T5, a little stronger than a netherite sword, and different by kind: daggers damage 8.8, speed 2; swords, katanas and rapiers 11 and 1.6; spears, halberds and glaives 13 and 1.35; greatswords, hammers and battleaxes 16 and 1.1.",
	]
	task.33584954CDA1402B.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.40184F99961A1B00.title: "Geared Arsenal"
	quest.40184F99961A1B00.quest_desc: [
		"Create Tools n Weapons.",
		" ",
		"How to make: a mechanical crafter: a netherite sword (or axe), a precision mechanism, 3 brass sheets, industrial iron, a gantry shaft and cogwheels. There are also a pickaxe, a shovel and a hoe.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T5: the sword damage 9.5, speed 1.8; the axe 12 and 1.2.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	task.7C17047740CEDF82.title: "Any item from the list"
	quest.40AEFB360E37CCDB.title: "Warden Sword"
	quest.40AEFB360E37CCDB.quest_desc: [
		"Deeper and Darker.",
		" ",
		"How to make: smithing table: the warden template, a netherite sword (or a Garnished netherite hatchet) and a reinforced echo shard: an echo shard, 4 warden carapaces and 4 phantom membranes.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: the template lies in the secret room of the Otherside's ancient temple, the carapaces in ancient vases and the chests of the same temple.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T6: the sword damage 13, speed 1.6; the hatchet 10 and 1.3.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
	]
	quest.1D3A3C518F2002BA.title: "The Incinerator"
	quest.1D3A3C518F2002BA.quest_desc: [
		"Cataclysm.",
		" ",
		"How to make: crafting table: a netherite sword, 2 ignitium ingots and 4 blaze rods.",
		" ",
		"Where to get: ignitium drops from Ignis, the Burning Arena in the Nether.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T6: damage 16, speed 1.4, reaches 2 blocks further.",
	]
	task.0D2AFC90364D47CB.title: "Any item from the list"
