	quest.5696EB92584A1EAF.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: Basic Weapons, a club of 2 planks or stones and a stick, a hammer of 5 stones and 2 sticks. A Garnished hatchet is 2 stones or copper ingots, 2 sticks and string. The Epic Knights mace and morning star are 3 copper ingots, a stick and a hilt (a stick and a leather strip).",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T0: damage 5.7-8, speed 0.8-1.5.",
