	quest.39E575E70A002F44.title: "Brass-Era Hatchets"
	quest.39E575E70A002F44.quest_desc: [
		"How to make: the brass one is 2 brass ingots, 2 sticks and string, the quartz one 2 nether quartz, 2 sticks and string. The rose quartz one is built on a mechanical crafter: 2 polished rose quartz, an iron sheet, a gold ingot, a zinc handle and string. The blazing one is a golden hatchet and powdered obsidian in a heated mixer.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T2: damage 7.5-9, speed 1.2-1.5.",
