	quest.3036DC6F030ECF28.title: "Steel Maces and Hammers"
	quest.3036DC6F030ECF28.quest_desc: [
		"Epic Knights in TFMG steel.",
		" ",
		"How to make: the mace and the morning star are 3 steel ingots, a stick and a hilt, the hammer 4, the flail also a steel chain. The barbed club is 2 steel ingots, 4 steel nuggets and a stick, the blacksmith hammer 5 ingots, a stick and a hilt.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"Tier T4: damage 9.4-17.9, speed 0.9-1.15. The maces, hammers and flail have 15-16 strength.",
		" ",
		"",
		" ",
		"§7Any one item from the list completes the quest, the rest are optional (click for the recipe).§r",
